  "notable_quotes": [
    "Hydrothermal synthesis with aromatic carboxylate coligands yielded two new dmtrz-based Zn frameworks: [Zn(dmtrz)(btrc)1/3]n and [Zn2(dmtrz)2(btec)(H2O)2]n.",
    "The btrc ligand in 1 uses bridging monodentate tricarboxylate coordination to three Zn centers, giving a loh1 topology with Schläfli symbol {43}2{46·66·83}3.",
    "Trz-based complexes with aromatic acid coligands remain limited, likely because synthesis often gives insoluble, intractable polycrystalline powders."
  ],
